      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client -> REST -> (Agents + Services) -> Repositories -> PostgreSQL / Redis / pgvector\nIngestion pipelines write raw source data into PostgreSQL and embeddings into pgvector, independent of live request traffic.\nSee docs/architecture-proposal.md for the full product, AI, database, and API architecture.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 36.0,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client -> REST -> (Agents + Services) -> Repositories -> PostgreSQL / Redis / pgvector\nIngestion pipelines write raw source data into PostgreSQL and embeddings into pgvector, independent of live request traffic.\nSee docs/architecture-proposal.md for the full product, AI, database, and API architecture.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
